		{
			"id":"983634ae1115a699",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# CSS scope escape:  injecting CSS in web rendering libraries",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-540,
			"y":-540,
			"width":1200,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"9fd2bc69fb80c096",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Many graphic/diagram libraries accept custom CSS without sanitizing it",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible"},
			"x":-540,
			"y":-200,
			"width":500,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"6d7cf0f76cf2c4da",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# CVE-2022-31108\nhttps://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid/security/advisories/GHSA-x3vm-38hw-55wf\n# CVE-2025-46340\nhttps://github.com/misskey-dev/misskey/security/advisories/GHSA-3p2w-xmv5-jm95\n## CVE-2026-41159\nhttps://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid/security/advisories/GHSA-87f9-hvmw-gh4p\n# CVE-2026-50159\nhttps://github.com/advisories/GHSA-6x64-9x62-f2gx\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible"},
			"x":20,
			"y":-210,
			"width":1000,
			"height":830
		},
		{
			"id":"b8b15899a465c6fa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"A platform that accepts and renders user-supplied content using a vulnerable library may be exposed to CSS injection.",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible"},
			"x":-540,
			"y":-40,
			"width":500,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"6ff7dc7d6698dce0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Through CSS injection, we can extract sensitive data from the DOM (eg. sensitive attributes values in HTML forms)",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible"},
			"x":-540,
			"y":140,
			"width":500,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"a3c5050ec2e5d4c3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"*Can static analysis detect when CSS generated by client-side rendering libraries can escape the intended DOM boundary of the rendered component?*",
			"styleAttributes":{"border":"invisible"},
			"x":-540,
			"y":-360,
			"width":1200,
			"height":100
		}
	],
